      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Clearing memory after a short time is smart, but can lead to regular hitches, I wonder if it's not better to unload unused assets as soon as an avatar is changed? I mean, there is already a local cache, you don't have to keep things in memory.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
