      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm this. Launching VRChat uses 830 MiB of VRAM on my home. Changing worlds doesn't free up all the used VRAM, so after visiting many worlds, if I return to my home world, I would expect to have approximately the same VRAM used as when I launched the game, not the double, triple or even more VRAM used.\n\nPS: no avatars were shown during the test, so I am pointing a 100% worlds memory leak issue here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
